{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a salted fish has dreams \u2014 big dreams!Dive into a pure Roguelike experience! This indie-developed 2D side-scrolling shooter first launched on Android in 2018 and is now available on Steam.<br>Explore randomly generated dungeon depths, encounter uniquely designed rooms and monsters, and cleverly combine over 130 diverse items to trigger powerful effects and continuously strengthen your abilities. Face off in an epic final battle against the iconic B-shaped monster and take on the ultimate challenge! Charge forward into the unknown and defeat the boss lurking at the end of the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:<br>\u30fb12 unique characters with different abilities<br>\u30fb130+ items with various effects<br>\u30fb20+ types of rooms<br>\u30fbMultiple enemy and boss varieties<br>\u30fbBranching paths in the final stage</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981230?t=1757854010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981230/f2c80cbb863888cbc7653e19177822b0b08d83ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757854010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981230/312b19ee288eb86bb9201603fd325be6fe250663/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757854010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981230/312b19ee288eb86bb9201603fd325be6fe250663/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757854010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a salted fish has dreams \u2014 big dreams!Dive into a pure Roguelike experience! This indie-developed 2D side-scrolling shooter first launched on Android in 2018 and is now available on Steam.<br>Explore randomly generated dungeon depths, encounter uniquely designed rooms and mon